Lurkmoar MVP — apply / ops notes
=================================

Paths
  App root:   /workspace/lurkmoar/
  Venv:       /workspace/lurkmoar/.venv/
  Data:       /workspace/lurkmoar/data/listings.json
              /workspace/lurkmoar/data/radar.json

Port
  8787  (HTTP, bind 0.0.0.0)

Start command
  /workspace/lurkmoar/.venv/bin/python /workspace/lurkmoar/app.py

  Or from app root:
  .venv/bin/python app.py
  ./run.sh

Background example
  nohup .venv/bin/python app.py > /tmp/lurkmoar.log 2>&1 &
  echo $!   # PID

Stop
  kill $(pgrep -f '/workspace/lurkmoar/app.py')
  # or kill <PID>

Local open
  http://127.0.0.1:8787/
  http://127.0.0.1:8787/radar
  http://127.0.0.1:8787/post

Domain attach (when GoDaddy mapped)
  - Point A/CNAME at host
  - Reverse-proxy :80/:443 → 127.0.0.1:8787 (nginx sketch in README)
  - Optional: systemd unit; change secret_key; certbot TLS

Health check
  curl -s -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\n' http://127.0.0.1:8787/

